    level2: "Create a Postman Collection with 5 RESTCONF requests that form a workflow: (1) GET all interfaces, (2) GET a specific interface, (3) PATCH description and MTU of the interface, (4) POST to add a new IPv4 address, (5) DELETE to remove the added address. Use Postman tests to assert response status codes (200, 204, 201) and verify JSON response bodies contain expected fields.",
